***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Science!<\/strong><\/p><p>This tour is for students commencing in <strong>Bachelor of Science<\/strong>&nbsp;and associated double degrees.&nbsp;<\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to explore the state-of-the-art laboratory spaces on offer for science students in your disciplines. The tour will be led by QUT Connect student volunteers and laboratory technicians.<\/p><p>The tour meeting point will be Gardens Point - P Block Room 421. Student volunteers will take attendees the labs from there.<\/p><p>Please ensure you have booked into a \"Welcome to Science\" orientation session in addition to this tour.<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Monday; we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
