***REMOVED***"summary": "This is a highly important session for all international students, as it provides essential information to help you understand and confidently use your OSHC cover while studying at QUT",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Welcome to Australia!!!&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\ud83d\udc28<\/p><p><strong>New to QUT? Or still a little confused about your OSHC? You are not alone and this session is for you!&nbsp;<\/strong>\ud83e\udd17<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><img src=\"\/files\/shared\/3RLKVPofLpvSBwCP7lAedB36E1XYJWedlwlub31cVKE1\/Event-6886447-Details-7c3b78c7e1f44eee8f62fc457b09e8e4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 562px\"><\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><\/tbody><\/table><p><em style=\"background-color: initial\">\ud83d\udccc<\/em><em><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\"><span style=\"\">This session is perfect if you are:<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p><p> \u2022 A new international student starting your journey in Australia<br> \u2022 A continuing student who may have missed a Medibank session before<br> \u2022 Someone who just wants a simple stress free refresher on what you are covered for<\/p><p><strong>You will hear from Heidi Medibank\u2019s QUT Partnership Coordinator along with Helen and Clair QUT international student interns who understand first hand what it is like to navigate OSHC as a student.<\/strong><\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><\/tbody><\/table><em style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif\">\ud83d\udccc<\/em><em style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\">Together we will chat about:<\/span><\/em><p> \u2022 How to use your OSHC confidently without the confusion<br> \u2022 Where to go when you need help support or medical care<br> \u2022 What the QUT and Medibank partnership means for you<br> \u2022 What is new and helpful in your Medibank OSHC Comprehensive cover<\/p><p>There will also be a live Q and A at the end so feel free to bring your questions big or small.<\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><\/tbody><\/table><p><em style=\"background-color: initial\">\ud83d\udccc<\/em><em><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\">Attend in person and win:<\/span><\/em><br> All students who attend the session in person will be entered into a <strong>prize draw<\/strong>, with winners announced at the end of the session. Come along, learn something valuable, and you might walk away with a prize too.<\/p><p>If you cannot attend live do not worry. All registered students will receive a recording of the session and a PDF copy of the slides to keep for later.<\/p><p>Think of this session as your OSHC explained clearly casually and with real student experiences in mind. We would love to see you there!<\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><\/tbody><\/table><p><em style=\"background-color: initial\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/em><em><u>The session will cover the following topics:<br><\/u><\/em><\/p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>QUT &amp; Medibank Partnership Overview of<br>the Medibank OSHC App<\/strong><br><ul><li>how to active &amp; get your card<\/li><li>student rewards<\/li><\/ul><strong>Advantages of OSHC Comprehensive<\/strong><ul><li>what are you covered for<\/li><li>what are you not covered for<\/li><li>where &amp; when to see a doctor<\/li><li>where to get medicine<\/li><li>in case of emergencies<\/li><li>online doctor<\/li><li>how to claim<\/li><\/ul><\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">dfvvd<\/span><\/td><td><strong>Health &amp; Wellbeing Support<\/strong><ul><li>free events in the community<\/li><li>sponsored events at QUT<\/li><\/ul><strong><br><br><br>Medibank Resources<\/strong><ul><li>on campus support<\/li><li>Medibank phones lines<\/li><li>need to extend or upgrade your cover<\/li><li>Medibank videos<\/li><\/ul><strong>Q&amp;A session<\/strong><img src=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/files\/shared\/CcTrUAjTqG9nSaiaO-_q_fD07YZDfOb7vtYtwcyc-Ro1\/Medibank-Live-Better-Colour-LOGO_Main.png\" alt=\"***REMOVED*** \" style=\"width: 169px; display: block; float: right; margin: 0 0 10px 10px\"><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table> <table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><\/tbody><\/table><em style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/em><u><em>There are alternative Sessions:<\/em><\/u><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Monday 16th February<\/strong><br>2:00-3:00pm<br>GP-X Block, Gardens Theatre <br><em><strong>or&nbsp;<\/strong><strong><\/strong><\/em><a href=\" https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6886558\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Online<\/span><\/a>\ud83d\udd17<\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">aaa<\/span><\/td><td><strong>Tuesday 17th February<\/strong><br>2:00-3:00pm<br>KG-B Block (B101) <br><em><em><strong>or&nbsp;<\/strong><\/em><\/em><a href=\" https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6886560\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Online<\/span><\/a>\ud83d\udd17<\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">aaa<\/span><\/td><td> <strong>Wednesday 25th February<\/strong><br>2:00-3:00pm<br>GP-D Block (D106) <br><em><em><strong>or&nbsp;<\/strong><\/em><\/em><a href=\" https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6886561\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Online<\/span><\/a>\ud83d\udd17<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><br><br>",
