***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the<strong> Faculty of Health!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in<strong> Bachelor of&nbsp;<\/strong><strong>Behavioural Science (<\/strong><strong>Psychology)<\/strong><strong style=\"background-color: initial\">&nbsp;<\/strong>and associated double degrees.<\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul><li>learn about your degree structure, majors (if applicable) and course requirements;<\/li><li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your degree;<\/li><li>discover study and personal support services available;<\/li><li>to connect with fellow students, and meet academic and professional staff.<\/li><\/ul><p>If you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree.<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>If you are unable to attend in person, please register for the online version of this information session, details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage. It is not necessary to attend both in-person and online sessions as similar content will be covered.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Tuesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
