***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Creative Industries, Education and Social Justice!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in the&nbsp;<strong>Bachelor of Education (Primary)<\/strong>&nbsp;degree.<\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul> <li>learn about your degree structure, majors (if applicable) and course requirements;<\/li><li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your degree;<\/li><li>discover study and personal support services available;<\/li><li>to connect with fellow students, and meet academic and professional staff.<\/li><\/ul><p>If you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree.<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available to QUT students and staff after the conclusion of the event.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Tuesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
