***REMOVED***"details": "<p>\n\tWelcome to the <strong>Faculty of Engineering!<\/strong><\/p><p>\n\tThis orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>Bachelor of Built Environment<\/strong>&nbsp;single and associated double degrees.<\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 20px\">\n\t<b style=\"background-color: initial\">a.<\/b> Bachelor of Built***REMOVED***   Environment (Honours)(Interior Design)<\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 20px\">\n\t<b style=\"background-color: initial\">b.<\/b> Bachelor of Built***REMOVED***   Environment (Honours)(Landscape Architecture)<\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 20px\">\n\t<b style=\"background-color: initial\">c.<\/b> Bachelor of Built***REMOVED***   Environment (Honours)(Urban and Regional Planning)<\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 20px\">\n\t<b style=\"background-color: initial\">d.<\/b> Bachelor of Built***REMOVED***   Environment (Honours)(Construction Management and Quantity Surveying)<\/p><p>\n\tIn this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>learn about your degree structure, majors (if applicable) and course requirements;<\/li>\t\n<li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your degree;<\/li>\t\n<li>discover study and personal support services available;<\/li><li>take a tour of the cutting-edge workshop spaces;<\/li>\t\n<li>to connect with fellow students, and meet academic and professional staff.<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\tIf you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree.<\/p><p>\n\tThis is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>\n\tThis information session contains a QUT Connect session&nbsp;which will include light refreshments.&nbsp;Please keep an eye out for our Connectors who will guide you to your Connect session in a nearby location.<\/p><p>\n\tThis orientation session is taking place on Tuesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
