***REMOVED***"summary": "This is a highly important session for all international students, as it provides essential information to help you understand and confidently use your OSHC cover while studying at QUT",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Welcome to Australia!!! \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\ud83d\udc28<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>New to QUT? Or still a little confused about your OSHC? You are not alone and this session is for you! \ud83e\udd17<\/strong><\/p><p><img src=\"\/files\/shared\/8tCDyK97c4cAwOWe7xyq7EZ_uQw2PSYqe8j04C7aOoU1\/Event-6886516-Details-60137844fca94126bc9e6472af3755f4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 562px\"><\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><em><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\">\ud83d\udcccThis session is perfect if you are:<\/span><\/em><br> \u2022 A new international student starting your journey in Australia.<br> \u2022 A continuing student who may have missed a Medibank session before<br> \u2022 Someone who just wants a simple stress free refresher on what you are covered for.<\/p><p><strong>You will hear from Heidi Medibank\u2019s QUT Partnership Coordinator along with Helen and Clair QUT international student interns who understand first hand what it is like to navigate OSHC as a student.<br><\/strong><\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><em style=\"background-color: initial\">\ud83d\udccc<\/em><em><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\">Together we will chat about:<\/span><\/em><br>\u2022 How to use your OSHC confidently without the confusion<br>\u2022 Where to go when you need help support or medical care<br>\u2022 What the QUT and Medibank partnership means for you<br>\u2022 What is new and helpful in your Medibank OSHC Comprehensive cover<\/p><p>There will also be a live Q and A at the end so feel free to bring your questions big or small.<\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><em style=\"background-color: initial\">\ud83d\udccc<\/em><em><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\">Attend in person and win:<\/span><\/em><br><strong>All students who attend the session in person will be entered into a prize draw<\/strong>, with winners announced at the end of the session. Come along, learn something valuable, and you might walk away with a prize too.<\/p><p>If you cannot attend live do not worry. All registered students will receive a recording of the session and a PDF copy of the slides to keep for later.<\/p><p>Think of this session as your OSHC explained clearly casually and with real student experiences in mind. We would love to see you there!<\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><\/tbody><\/table><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><\/tbody><\/table><p><em>\ud83d\udcdd<u>The session will cover the following topics:<\/u><\/em><\/p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>QUT &amp; Medibank Partnership Overview of<br>the Medibank OSHC App<\/strong><br><ul><li>how to active &amp; get your card<\/li><li>student rewards<\/li><\/ul><strong>Advantages of OSHC Comprehensive<\/strong><ul><li>what are you covered for<\/li><li>what are you not covered for<\/li><li>where &amp; when to see a doctor<\/li><li>where to get medicine<\/li><li>in case of emergencies<\/li><li>online doctor<\/li><li>how to claim<\/li><\/ul><\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">dfvv<strong>d<\/strong><\/span><\/td><td><strong>Health &amp; Wellbeing Support<\/strong><ul><li>free events in the community<\/li><li>sponsored events at QUT<\/li><\/ul><strong>Medibank Resources<\/strong><ul><li>on campus support<\/li><li>Medibank phones lines<\/li><li>need to extend or upgrade your cover<\/li><li>Medibank videos<\/li><\/ul><br><strong>Q&amp;A session<\/strong><img src=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/files\/shared\/CcTrUAjTqG9nSaiaO-_q_fD07YZDfOb7vtYtwcyc-Ro1\/Medibank-Live-Better-Colour-LOGO_Main.png\" alt=\"***REMOVED*** \" style=\"width: 169px; display: block; float: right; margin: 0 0 10px 10px\"><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><table><tbody><tr><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><em style=\"background-color: initial\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/em><u><em>There are alternative Sessions:<\/em><\/u><\/p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Monday 16th February<br>2:00-3:00pm<\/strong><br>GP-X Block, Gardens Theatre<br><em>or&nbsp;<\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6886558\"><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Online<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">\ud83d\udd17<\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">aaa<\/span><\/td><td><strong>Tuesday 17th February<\/strong><br>2:00-3:00pm<br>KG-B Block (B101)<br><em><em>or&nbsp;<\/em><\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6886560\"><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Online<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">\ud83d\udd17<\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">aaa<\/span><\/td><td><strong>Wednesday 25th February<\/strong><br>2:00-3:00pm<br>GP-D Block (D106)<br><em><em>or&nbsp;<\/em><\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6886561\"><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Online<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">\ud83d\udd17<\/span><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>",
