***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Business and Law!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong style=\"background-color: initial\">Bachelor of Business<\/strong> and associated double degrees (all majors).<\/p><p>Your informative and interactive program will consist of the following, with prizes up for grabs throughout the day. <\/p><p>NB: <em>Please bring a water bottle (filling stations are available around campus).<\/em><\/p><p><strong>9.00-10.00am:<\/strong> <strong>Business Information session<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>an overview of the degree structure, course requirements and available study and support services<\/li><li>includes an engaging discussion panel with current and Alumni students<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>10.15-12.15pm<\/strong>:  <strong>Interactive Workshops<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>You will move to smaller rooms and engage in interactive and informative activities with peers and academics!<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>12.30 \u2013 1.45pm: Lunch on the Lawn<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Join us for a catered, light Lunch on the Kidney Lawn*<\/li><li>Mingle with staff and peers<\/li><li>Visit the various Student Club stalls on the Lawn<\/li><\/ul><p>* <em>Whilst we will have a variety of lunch boxes to cater for some dietary needs, if you have detailed requirements, you may prefer to bring your own lunch or purchase from the retailers on campus.<\/em><\/p><p><strong>2.00-3.30pm: Connect \u2018101\u2019<\/strong><\/p><p>You will then return to your original workshop room for the final session of the day.<\/p><ul> <li>Volunteer students will provide you with a \"101\" of all things QUT, including support services, IT, and the student experience outside the classroom. <\/li><li>Further opportunity to socialise with peers in your course and ask questions.<\/li><\/ul><p>If you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree, which may be on a different day.<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session including catering. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend - or cancel in a timely manner if your plans need to change!<\/p><p>If you would prefer to attend online or are unable to make it to campus, you may register for the <strong>Online<\/strong> Business session instead. Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> .<\/p>",
