***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Business and Law!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>Bachelor of Business<\/strong> and associated double degrees (all majors) - and is being conducted online.<\/p><p>Please join us for the following sessions:&nbsp;NB: <em style=\"background-color: initial\">you will need to register to attend both sessions separately via&nbsp;<\/em><em>the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a><\/em><em> webpage&nbsp;<\/em><em style=\"background-color: initial\">due to different zoom links.<\/em><\/p><p><strong><u>This is for&nbsp;Session 1<\/u>. 9.00-10.00am:<\/strong> <strong>Business Information session<\/strong><\/p><p><em>This is being Live Streamed from one of the on campus theatres on the day, providing<\/em><\/p><ul> <li>an overview of the degree structure, course requirements and available study and support services<\/li><li>and includes an engaging discussion panel with current and Alumni students<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Session 2 (register separately)&nbsp;10.15-12.15pm<\/strong>:  <strong>Interactive Workshop<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>academically facilitated session <\/li><li>engaging, interactive and informative activities with your peers! <\/li><\/ul><p>If you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree, which may be on a different day.<\/p><p>This is an <strong>online<\/strong> orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available to QUT students and staff after the conclusion of the event.<\/p><p>An in-person version of this session is available. If you would prefer attending in-person, please register for the <strong>on-campus<\/strong> version of this information session. Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage. <\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> . Students are also encouraged to attend a <strong>QUT Connect<\/strong> session either on campus or <a href=\"http:\/\/can%20be%20found%20on%20the%20your%20orientation%20webpage\/\">Online<\/a>.<\/p>",
