***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Business and Law!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>ID26&nbsp;<\/strong><strong>Bachelor of Business and Property Economics.<\/strong><\/p><p>Your morning program is focusing on the <em>Business side<\/em> of your degree and&nbsp;will consist of the following, with prizes up for grabs throughout the day.<\/p><p>NB: <em>Please bring a water bottle (filling stations are available around campus).<\/em><\/p><p><strong>9.00-10.00am: Business Information session<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>an overview of the degree structure, course requirements and available study and support services<\/li><li>includes an engaging discussion panel with current and Alumni students<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>10.15-12.15pm: Interactive Workshops<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>You will move to smaller rooms and engage in interactive and informative activities with peers and academics!<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>12.30 \u2013 1.30pm: Lunch on the Lawn<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Join us for a catered, light Lunch on the Kidney Lawn*<\/li><li>Mingle with staff and peers<\/li><li>Visit the various Student Club stalls on the Lawn<\/li><\/ul><p>* <em>Whilst we will have a variety of lunch boxes to cater for some dietary needs, if you have detailed requirements, you may prefer to bring your own lunch or purchase from the retailers on campus.<\/em><\/p><p><em><br><\/em><\/p><p>As you are studying a double degree with Property Economics<em>,<\/em> you will also be required to register for the <em>Welcome to Property Economics<\/em>&nbsp;(ID26) orientation session in the afternoon from<strong>&nbsp;1.30pm-4.30pm<\/strong>. Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.&nbsp;<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session including catering. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend - or cancel in a timely manner if your plans need to change!.<\/p><p>If you would prefer to attend online or are unable to make it to campus, you may register for the <strong>Online<\/strong> discipline session instead, <em>based on your chosen Major<\/em>. Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> .<\/p>",
