***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong style=\"background-color: initial\">Faculty of Business and Law!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>Bachelor of Property Economics <\/strong>and associated double degrees.<\/p><p>This is an <u>optional<\/u> event for students wanting to broaden their network by joining in some fun and engaging activities with our 'business' students in the morning. Your actual <em>Welcome to Property Economics<\/em> orientation session is in the afternoon (details&nbsp;about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.)<\/p><p>(For this session, business students will initially be attending a Business Welcome and then moving to smaller rooms for interactive workshops - <em>this is where you will join them!<\/em>)<\/p><p>NB: <em>Please bring a water bottle (filling stations are available around campus).<\/em><\/p><p><strong>Logistics:<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>10.15-12.15pm: Interactive Workshops<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Please arrive on time to register (and collect your lunch voucher) before engaging&nbsp;in interactive and informative activities with peers and academics - prizes up for grabs!<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>12.30 \u2013 1.30pm: Lunch on the Lawn<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Join us for a catered, light Lunch on the Kidney Lawn*<\/li><li>Mingle with staff and peers<\/li><li>Visit the various Student Club stalls on the Lawn<\/li><\/ul><p>* <em>Whilst we will have a variety of lunch boxes to cater for some dietary needs, if you have detailed requirements, you may prefer to bring your own lunch or purchase from the retailers on campus.<\/em><\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session including catering. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend - or cancel in a timely manner if your plans need to change!<\/p>",
