***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Business and Law!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>Bachelor of Property Economics <\/strong>and associated double degrees.<\/p><p>This <strong>Property Economics<\/strong>&nbsp;session will include the following:<\/p><p><strong>1.30-3.00pm<\/strong>:&nbsp;<\/p><ul>   <li>30 minutes of welcome***REMOVED***  including an interactive discussion panel (<em>current property students***REMOVED***  and recent graduates<\/em><strong>)<\/strong><\/li>  <li>60 minutes of networking***REMOVED***  and property related in-class activities<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>3.00-4.30pm:<\/strong> Connect 101<\/p><ul>   <li>Volunteer students will***REMOVED***  provide you with a \"101\" of all things QUT, including support***REMOVED***  services, IT, and the student experience outside the classroom. <\/li>  <li>Further opportunity to***REMOVED***  socialise with peers in your course and ask questions.<\/li><\/ul><p>As you are studying a double degree with <strong>Business<\/strong>, you will also be required to attend the <em>Welcome to Business (for ID26)<\/em>&nbsp;orientation session being offered in the morning.&nbsp;Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>An online version of this session is available. If you would prefer attending online or are unable to make it to campus, please register for the <strong>online<\/strong> version of this information session. Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> , including visiting the student club stalls on the Kidney Lawn from 11-2pm.<\/p>",
