***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Business and Law!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>B<\/strong><strong>achelor of Property Economics<\/strong>&nbsp;and associated double degrees.<\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul> <li>learn about your degree structure, majors (if applicable) and course requirements;<\/li><li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your degree;<\/li><li>discover study and personal support services available;<\/li><li>connect with fellow students, and talk with academic staff.<\/li><\/ul><p>If you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree, which may be on a different day.<\/p><p>This is an <strong>online<\/strong> orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available to QUT students and staff after the conclusion of the event.<\/p><p>An in-person version of this session is available. If you would prefer attending in-person, please register for the <strong>on-campus<\/strong> version of this information session. Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.&nbsp;<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.&nbsp;Students are also encouraged to attend a <strong>QUT Connect<\/strong> session either on campus or <a href=\"http:\/\/can%20be%20found%20on%20the%20your%20orientation%20webpage\/\">Online<\/a>.<\/p>",
