***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Science!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in a <strong>Postgraduate Information Technology<\/strong>, <strong>Artificial Intelligence<\/strong>, or <strong>Cyber Security<\/strong> course.<\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul> <li>learn about your degree structure, majors (if applicable) and course requirements;<\/li><li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your degree;<\/li><li>discover study and personal support services available;<\/li><li>to connect with fellow students, and meet academic and professional staff.<\/li><\/ul><p><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/Detail\/6188221\"><\/a><\/p><p>There is an additional information session happening on Friday hosted by the Student Success Team. You can view details on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.<\/p><p>This is an online orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>If you would prefer to attend in person, please register for the in-person version of this information session, details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage.&nbsp;Please note that the online session is a livestream of the in-person session. Please only register for the session you will be attending.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available via the online orientation platform after the conclusion of the event. The online orientation platform is available to QUT staff and students only.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Thursday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
